<!-- Knack (CUSA00068 01.10; also CUSA00006 / CUSA00004 when the code matches): cheats.
     From the PS4 cheat "Knack 01.10" by Web Xx (HEN Cheats Collection, CUSA00068_01.10_d5e8d217.json).
     Each site is found by its signature (Pattern/At), so other builds use them where the code is the same.
     - God Mode: the damage function at 0xfe330 copies its damage arguments (edx, esi) to r14d/r13d;
       they are zeroed instead (xor r14d,r14d; xor r13d,r13d).
     - Crystals don't drain: the three "meter - cost" subtractions keep the meter (vmovaps xmm0,xmm1).
     - Crystals fill to max on pickup: the "jge" that caps a pickup's add is removed. -->
